# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，检出时按平台自动转换，避免三平台 CI 出现幽灵 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做任何转换（黄金图基线尤其重要）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.exe binary

# 让 GitHub 正确识别语言构成
docs/** linguist-documentation
prototype/** linguist-documentation
